#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:5
#: 439d99c4093e468d8c6a127db1b7048d
msgid "Mission Planner CLI Setup Test modes"
msgstr "Mission Planner CLI 设置测试模式"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:8
#: 224da3736f334f479cba3c66ebe4cb38
msgid "Command Line Interpreter"
msgstr "命令行解释器"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:10
#: ce6c0fd5620a4c32aa79ab16e0b1146d
msgid ""
"The Mission Planner Command Line interpreter is a serial terminal line "
"editor that works similarly to the way the old DOS prompt operating systems "
"used to work. If you want, you can set up and test APM is via a Command Line"
" Interpreter (CLI). It is only available via the USB cable and it cannot be "
"used via an Xbee or 3DR wireless telemetry connection. Open up the Terminal "
"in the Mission Planner by selecting the Terminal tab (ensure that the serial"
" baud rate is set for 115200). This will bring up the Terminal window, and "
"it should automatically take you to the APM CLI menu (if not, click in the "
"window and hit \"Enter\" three times):"
msgstr ""
"Mission Planner 命令行解释器是一个串行终端行编辑器，工作方式类似于旧 DOS "
"提示符操作系统。如果需要，您可以通过命令行解释器（CLI）设置和测试 APM。它只能通过 USB 线缆使用，无法通过 Xbee 或 3DR "
"无线数传连接使用。通过选择 Terminal 标签在 Mission Planner 中打开终端（确保串口波特率设置为 "
"115200）。这将打开终端窗口，它应该会自动带您到 APM CLI 菜单（如果没有，请在窗口中点击并按三次「Enter」）："

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:24
#: 2f54e0f2debc401082c1a0362d950f32
msgid ""
"You can now enter commands by typing them at the command prompt. You can "
"always type \"exit\" to leave any mode. In the following examples, I'll be "
"using another serial terminal (in this case the Arduino Serial Monitor). You"
" can use any terminal you want, but the Mission Planner terminal is the most"
" straightforward. Here I'm typing \"help\" to see a list of available "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"现在您可以在命令提示符下输入命令。您可以随时输入「exit」退出任何模式。在以下示例中，我将使用另一个串行终端（本例中为 Arduino "
"串行监视器）。您可以使用任何终端，但 Mission Planner 终端是最直接的。这里我输入「help」以查看可用命令列表："

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:35
#: 68933aaca7df419e9cdfc9904801dc8c
msgid "Initial commands are:"
msgstr "初始命令为："

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:37
#: 9f92822566364d8a8734283e41df1115
msgid "**logs**: Log readback/setup mode. Used after flying)"
msgstr "**logs**：日志读取/设置模式（飞行后使用）"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:38
#: efc899688ad54fec85a006076137bdaf
msgid "**setup**: Initial setup mode)"
msgstr "**setup**：初始设置模式"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:39
#: f87166f7096b43d6be4fad1734ead820
msgid "**test**: Test mode)"
msgstr "**test**：测试模式"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:42
#: b4737dc87fc24267a55e4cccffed2972
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "设置"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:44
#: 7d174ecfe0ef4dfb8179d8d828003d5c
msgid ""
"The Setup process configures APM for your particular RC radio settings and "
"desired flight modes. Type \"setup\" and hit return to enter this mode. "
"**You MUST setup both radio and modes before you can fly. You should also "
"test that you're getting GPS lock (using the gps command in the test mode), "
"which usually means testing outside where the GPS module has a clear view of"
" the sky.** Allowed setup commands are:"
msgstr ""
"设置过程为您特定的遥控设置和所需飞行模式配置 APM。输入「setup」并回车进入此模式。**您必须在飞行前设置遥控和模式。您还应测试是否能获得 GPS"
" 锁定（在测试模式下使用 gps 命令），这通常意味着需要在室外 GPS 模块能清晰看到天空的地方测试。** 允许的设置命令有："

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:51
#: 927dda16480e4213ac566511d34b6742
msgid "**reset**: Resets APM to default settings"
msgstr "**reset**：将 APM 重置为默认设置"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:52
#: ab76ad1364ae4b999ba214ecb8fb575d
msgid "**radio**: Sets up RC settings (see below)"
msgstr "**radio**：设置遥控设置（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:53
#: ffeb75d7675c45ed911cb018d553462e
msgid ""
"**modes**: Sets up flight control modes for each RC toggle switch position "
"(see below)"
msgstr "**modes**：为每个遥控拨动开关位置设置飞行控制模式（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:54
#: 7008e1c531ce4bbeb688e935fe516f55
msgid "**compass**: Enables compass. Commands are \"compass on\" or \"compass off\""
msgstr "**compass**：启用罗盘。命令为「compass on」或「compass off」"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:56
#: 3ac3268c09e749588922a27d4df62a73
msgid ""
"**declination**: Sets local magnetic declination for compass. You can find "
"your local declination at `this web page <http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/geomag-"
"web/>`__. Although it is given in minutes and seconds, enter it as a "
"decimal. So ``14° 10' E`` would be entered as 14.10."
msgstr ""
"**declination**：设置罗盘的本地磁偏角。您可以在 `此网页 <http://www.ngdc.noaa.gov/geomag-"
"web/>`__ 找到您当地的磁偏角。虽然它以分和秒给出，但请以小数输入。例如 ``14° 10' E`` 应输入为 14.10。"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:60
#: 0a63701f796741cfbefbff2202b303a0
msgid ""
"**\"battery\"**: Enables battery monitoring. Enter options 0-4 (repeat to "
"enter additional options):"
msgstr "**「battery」**：启用电池监控。输入选项 0-4（重复输入以添加其他选项）："

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:71
#: a740d200bb514f5ca1d28f7df077f3cd
msgid "**\"show\"**: Shows all current settings in EEPROM"
msgstr "**「show」**：显示 EEPROM 中的所有当前设置"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:72
#: 8efe1dea39c8407a9c9c8d28633260b8
msgid "**\"erase\"**: Erases EEPROM"
msgstr "**「erase」**：擦除 EEPROM"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:75
#: 6c2ee472b6c346d8aa054498c3e95516
msgid "Radio setup"
msgstr "遥控设置"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:77
#: fe6add3f15434664a92d817347370555
msgid ""
"*Note: APM does not power the RC receiver or servos (although the RC "
"equipment can power APM). If you have APM powered by USB, you must also "
"connect an ESC/Lipo or receiver battery to the RC APM pins (typically, the "
"ESC would be plugged into Out 3, while a receiver battery would typically be"
" plugged into your receiver, which would send power to APM via the RC "
"cables). If you do not separately power the RC system, APM will be unable to"
" read any signals on its RC inputs.* In this mode you must move both sticks "
"to all of their extremes, as follows: Move the right stick to the top right,"
" then bottom right, then top left, then bottom left. Then repeat for the "
"left stick. The order doesn't matter, but what's important is that you hit "
"all four corners for each stick. Hold the stick in each corner for a second."
" Here's a screenshot of a typical Radio setup process:"
msgstr ""
"*注意：APM 不为遥控接收机或舵机供电（尽管遥控设备可以为 APM 供电）。如果 APM 通过 USB 供电，您还必须将 "
"ESC/锂电池或接收机电池连接到 RC APM 引脚（通常 ESC 插入 Out 3，而接收机电池通常插入您的接收机，由其通过 RC 线缆向 APM "
"供电）。如果不单独为 RC 系统供电，APM 将无法读取 RC 输入上的任何信号。* "
"在此模式下，您必须将两个摇杆移动到所有极限位置，具体如下：将右摇杆移到右上角，然后右下角，然后左上角，然后左下角。左摇杆重复相同操作。顺序不重要，但重要的是每个摇杆都要触及全部四个角。在每个角停留一秒钟。以下是典型遥控设置过程的截图："

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:94
#: f8b78c9fe0ed4aa794e5176d383ad39f
msgid ""
"**Note**: As shown above, the RC readings for the channels you have hooked "
"up should be around 1,000-1,300 at the low end and around 1,900-2,000 at the"
" high end. (Readings of exactly 1,000 and 2,000 mean that channel's not "
"connected at all). If you are getting readings that are all around 1,500, "
"there are three likely causes:"
msgstr ""
"**注意**：如上所示，您已连接通道的遥控读数在低端应约为 1,000-1,300，在高端应约为 1,900-2,000。（恰好为 1,000 和 "
"2,000 的读数意味着该通道根本没有连接）。如果您读到的数值全在 1,500 左右，可能有三种原因："

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:100
#: e79ffc1b960a40fe94c6edd48505bf1b
msgid ""
"You didn't move both sticks to all four corners of their range during the "
"test, or did it too quickly."
msgstr "测试期间您没有将两个摇杆移动到各自范围的全部四个角，或操作太快。"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:102
#: bba418a55e3445d4847cdfd2151bddf6
msgid ""
"Your RC connections are plugged in wrong, either upside down, on the wrong "
"pins, or otherwise not making a connection"
msgstr "您的遥控连接插反了、插在了错误的引脚上，或没有形成连接"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:106
#: 767f799597294a3aa479bbb2b0cc2c27
msgid "Flight Control Modes"
msgstr "飞行控制模式"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:108
#: bff209c0c85d46f1b9c2aaca338e4fd7
msgid ""
"Here's how to set your flight control modes: In the CLI, enter setup mode. "
"Type \"modes\" and press return. You can now see the flight modes displayed "
"as you move your control switch to each position. If you want to change your"
" mode, use the rudder/aileron control stick on your radio. Just move the "
"stick to the right or left and the mode will increment. Hitting Enter will "
"exit the mode and save your changes. See this example:"
msgstr ""
"以下是设置飞行控制模式的方法：在 CLI "
"中进入设置模式。输入「modes」并回车。现在，当您将控制开关移到每个位置时，可以看到飞行模式的显示。如果要更改模式，请使用遥控上的方向舵/副翼控制摇杆。只需向右或向左移动摇杆，模式即会递增。按"
" Enter 退出该模式并保存更改。请参见以下示例："

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:119
#: 5426d5bae37a443c9b77038d9b2e1982
msgid "**Here's a video tutorial:**"
msgstr "**视频教程：**"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:125
#: 4508ceb81d724fc5a631cff6194b4187
msgid "Checking for reversed servos"
msgstr "检查舵机反向"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:127
#: 131706ba8ca840fc840f654735092dbb
msgid ""
"Now is a good time to go back and see if any of the DIP switches need to be "
"flip to reverse a servo. Instructions are :ref:`here <plane:reversing-"
"servos-and-setting-normalelevon-mode>`. And remember that if you're flying "
"an elevon plane (flying wing or delta), you should set the mixing with the "
"DIP switch, too. And if you're flying a regular plane and find that channel "
"1 and 2 are accidentally combined, that means you've accidentally got it in "
"the elevon mode. Push the last DIP switch down to return to normal."
msgstr ""
"现在是检查是否需要拨动任何 DIP 开关以反转舵机的好时机。说明请参阅 :ref:`此处 <plane:reversing-servos-and-"
"setting-normalelevon-mode>`。请记住，如果您飞行的是 elevon 飞机（飞翼或三角翼），也应使用 DIP "
"开关设置混控。如果您飞行的是普通飞机但发现通道 1 和 2 意外合并，说明您不小心启动了 elevon 模式。将最后一个 DIP 开关向下拨回正常模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:137
#: c81125bf58394c7e84f5a3db3ecf3c5d
msgid "Logs"
msgstr "日志"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:139
#: 35414e66494c4f45acba8e25181bcc36
msgid ""
"This mode allows you to read and manage flight log files in the onboard 16MB"
" dataflash memory. NOTE: You must use erase before trying to use the logging"
" function. Failure to do an erase first will cause problems and show false "
"results."
msgstr ""
"此模式允许您读取和管理板载 16MB 数据闪存中的飞行日志文件。注意：在尝试使用日志记录功能前必须先执行 erase。若未先执行 erase "
"将导致问题并显示错误结果。"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:144
#: d6f30bb20ea84a169b5a839dd1794c77
msgid "**\"dump (n)\"**: Dump log \"n\""
msgstr "**「dump (n)」**：转储日志「n」"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:145
#: b62995808e8c4390ba77d4fe102f6e2e
msgid "**\"erase\"**: Erase all logs"
msgstr "**「erase」**：擦除所有日志"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:146
#: 64f9c6d12e0d427196a9ddb60ab54a6a
msgid "**\"enable (name) or all\"**: Enable logging \"name\" or everything"
msgstr "**「enable (name) or all」**：启用日志「name」或全部"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:147
#: c8c0f587ac59460fbd56fecb62405599
msgid "**\"disable (name) or all\"**: Disable logging \"name\" or everything"
msgstr "**「disable (name) or all」**：禁用日志「name」或全部"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:150
#: 41d5664a1aae4e70b8b56296c9fb7e83
msgid "CLI APM Test Suite"
msgstr "CLI APM 测试套件"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:152
#: ab11788e814f41bebe920e8fad6c827b
msgid ""
"APM comes with a number of onboard tests. To use them, type \"test\" in the "
"CLI, and \"help\" to see all the different tests:"
msgstr "APM 附带了许多板载测试。要使用它们，在 CLI 中输入「test」，然后输入「help」查看所有不同测试："

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:155
#: c0932e58189742119933d3494edc61ca
msgid "**baro**: Shows the data from the barometer"
msgstr "**baro**：显示气压计数据"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:156
#: cf17adaf974c4f149b79ca5d80e5de43
msgid ""
"**compass**: Shows the data from the magnetometer, if one is connected and "
"enabled"
msgstr "**compass**：显示磁力计数据（若已连接并启用）"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:158
#: 8c070c5536d045c49219cdf375516aa9
msgid "**ins**: tests the accelerometers and gyros"
msgstr "**ins**：测试加速度计和陀螺仪"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:159
#: f2c19b69b81f4c60b8ab2b674350dbc3
msgid "**optflow**: Tests optical flow sensor"
msgstr "**optflow**：测试光流传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:160
#: 3c7c6e5958874877af380ce1c3bdac23
msgid ""
"**relay**: Tests the onboard relay (turns it on and off every five seconds; "
"you should hear it faintly click)"
msgstr "**relay**：测试板载继电器（每五秒开关一次；您应该能隐约听到点击声）"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:162
#: 3a83281d38c840718384bff6e0d7643d
msgid "**shell**: Provides access to the NSH shell (Pixhawk only)"
msgstr "**shell**：提供对 NSH shell 的访问（仅限 Pixhawk）"

#: ../../source/docs/cli-setup-test-modes.rst:163
#: 5761544c69c64f7c9b98bf24692f6744
msgid "**rangefinder**: Tests the rangefinder sensor"
msgstr "**rangefinder**：测试测距仪传感器"
